    "All four profiles contain 3000 raw observations. Every 100-sample window is retained here.",
    "The Rust-a run has tail clusters in windows 200-399 and 2500-2699 that are largely absent in Rust-b; all samples continue to count toward the failed p95/repeat-spread gates.",
