    "Whole-driver before/after GC totals cannot identify a specific sample pause. Zero generation-two collections is not evidence that lower-generation GC or scheduling caused no pauses.",
    "The next code candidate removes the real redundant per-operation engine lookup for live managers, binding only an immutable engine/module selection at construction or explicit reassignment. It does not cache live menus, translators, configuration, delivery outcomes or confirmations."
